Execution lane and decision (2026-10-22): Decision: dedicated T3 SQLite compatibility lane in the authoritative sibling repository /home/xertrov/src/refs/t3code. Current engines still declares ^24.13.1. Preserve that minimum and normalize raw positional/named buffers at the SQLite boundary with byte/getter/reader-worker regression coverage; verify existing fix before implementing. Do not alter live T3 or the frozen P9 proof candidate.